ption**\r\nTwo tests `testWrite()` and `testModifyProperty()` in the file `FileUtilsTest.java` are flaky beacuse they will fail after repeated test runs. Specifically, they create/modify a file but don't delete it or change it back, which pollutes the shared state. It's better to always clean state pollution so that some other tests won\u2019t fail in the future.\r\nOne can check the failure with two consecutive `mvn test` commands:\r\n```\r\nmvn  install -pl core -am -DskipTests\r\nmvn -pl core test -Dtest=com.ccoe.build.core.utils.FileUtilsTest\r\nmvn -pl core test -Dtest=com.ccoe.build.core.utils.FileUtilsTest\r\n```\r\n", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2022-05-07T19:36:54Z", "updated_at": "2022-08-16T02:53:16Z", "closed_at": "2022-08-16T02:53:16Z", "merged_at": "2022-08-16T02:53:16Z", "merge_commit_sha": "d2eab5d54497b1bf4411f1089321c0bb772da256", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "MundaneImmortal:fix-flaky", "ref": "fix-flaky", "repo": {"id": 482364627, "node_id": "R_kgDOHMBM0w", "name": "mTracker", "full_name": "MundaneImmortal/mTracker", "owner": {"login": "MundaneImmortal", "id": 68594013, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjY4NTk0MDEz", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/68594013?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/MundaneImmortal", "html_url": "https://github.com/MundaneImmortal", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MundaneImmortal/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MundaneImmortal/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MundaneImmortal/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MundaneImmortal/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MundaneImmortal/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MundaneImmortal/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/MundaneImmortal/